{
  "id": "button",
  "name": "按钮",
  "nav": "按钮",
  "en": "Button",
  "group": "按钮",
  "specRef": "",
  "summary": "扁平：纯色面或 1px 细边，不用渐变和投影。悬停加深一档，按下再加深一档并轻轻缩一下。6 种变体由强到弱，每个区域只放一个主按钮。顶栏\"评审\"可以切换圆角来比较。",
  "acceptance": [
    "**等待**：转圈贴在文字左边，文字和按钮宽度都不动；300ms 内完成就不显示转圈，出现后至少留 500ms。",
    "**成功**：对勾弹出，光泽扫过一次，只在\"完成\"的时刻用。",
    "**禁用**：整体降到 45%，悬停时用 Tooltip 说明原因，不在旁边另加一行灰字。",
    "**文字**：写明动作（\"删除项目\"），不写\"确定\"；按钮文字不换行。"
  ],
  "api": [
    {
      "title": "变体和尺寸",
      "head": [
        "写法",
        "说明"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ".sn-btn.sn-primary / sn-secondary / sn-tertiary / sn-ghost / sn-danger / sn-danger-soft",
          "6 种变体，由强到弱；每个区域只放一个主按钮"
        ],
        [
          ".sn-sm / （默认）/ .sn-lg",
          "高 28 / 32 / 40"
        ],
        [
          ".sn-ibtn",
          "只有图标的按钮（要写 data-tip 或 aria-label）"
        ],
        [
          "data-i=\"图标名:before\"",
          "图标在文字前；:after 在后；data-i 由 injectIcons 换成图标"
        ],
        [
          "aria-disabled=\"true\" + data-tip",
          "禁用：点了不响应，只把原因亮出来（不用 disabled，免得读屏跳过；要整页调过 setup()）"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "函数",
      "head": [
        "名称",
        "说明"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "buttonHTML({ text, variant, size, icon, tip, disabled })",
          "生成按钮的标记（纯字符串，服务端渲染也能用），和手写的一模一样"
        ],
        [
          "busy(按钮, 毫秒或 Promise)",
          "等待：300ms 内回来不转圈，转圈出现后至少留 500ms；期间点不了。返回 Promise"
        ],
        [
          "succeed(按钮)",
          "原地换成对勾，一会儿换回文字"
        ],
        [
          "prepBusy(按钮)",
          "提前把内容包好（避免第一次等待时排版跳一下）"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
  "usage": {
    "css": [
      "buttons.css"
    ],
    "api": [
      [
        "busy(按钮, 毫秒或 Promise)",
        "satin-ui/components"
      ],
      [
        "succeed(按钮)",
        "satin-ui/components"
      ],
      [
        "prepBusy(按钮)",
        "satin-ui/components"
      ],
      [
        "buttonHTML({ text, variant, size, icon, tip })",
        "satin-ui/components"
      ]
    ]
  },
  "example": {
    "3": {
      "html": "<!-- 可等待的按钮：busy() 会把内容包成 .sn-label，转圈和对勾都放在里面 -->\n<button class=\"sn-btn sn-primary\" id=\"save\">保存修改</button>",
      "js": "import { busy, succeed } from \"satin-ui/components\";\nimport \"satin-ui/css/buttons.css\";\n\nconst save = document.querySelector(\"#save\");\nsave.addEventListener(\"click\", async () => {\n  // 300ms 内回来不转圈；转圈出现后至少留 500ms；等待期间点不了\n  await busy(save, fetch(\"/api/projects/42\", { method: \"PUT\" }));\n  succeed(save); // 原地换成对勾，一会儿换回文字\n});"
    }
  },
  "demos": [
    {
      "caption": "变体 × 尺寸",
      "html": "<div id=\"btnSizes\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "caption": "状态（静态展示）",
      "html": "<div id=\"btnStates\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "caption": "图标位置和下拉",
      "html": "<div class=\"row\">\n      <button class=\"sn-btn sn-primary\" data-i=\"plus:before\">新建项目</button>\n      <button class=\"sn-btn sn-secondary\" data-i=\"upload:before\">导入原文</button>\n      <button class=\"sn-btn sn-secondary\" data-i=\"arrow-right:after\">下一步</button>\n      <div class=\"sn-select sn-inline-menu\"><button class=\"sn-btn sn-secondary\" data-menubtn data-prefix=\"排序：\" data-i=\"chevron-down:caret\">排序：最近更新</button>\n        <div class=\"sn-menu\" role=\"menu\"><div class=\"sn-item sn-sel\" data-i=\"check:chk\">最近更新</div><div class=\"sn-item\">名称</div><div class=\"sn-item\">创建时间</div></div></div>\n    </div>"
    },
    {
      "caption": "试一下：等待 → 成功",
      "html": "<div class=\"row\">\n      <button class=\"sn-btn sn-primary\" data-demo=\"save\"><span class=\"sn-sheen\"></span><span class=\"sn-label\"><span class=\"sn-spin\"></span><svg class=\"sn-tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" /></svg><span class=\"sn-txt\">保存修改</span></span></button>\n      <button class=\"sn-btn sn-secondary\" data-demo=\"quick\"><span class=\"sn-label\"><span class=\"sn-spin\"></span><svg class=\"sn-tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" /></svg><span class=\"sn-txt\">刷新（很快完成）</span></span></button>\n      <button class=\"sn-btn sn-danger\" data-demo=\"del\"><span class=\"sn-label\"><span class=\"sn-spin\"></span><svg class=\"sn-tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" /></svg><span class=\"sn-txt\">删除项目</span></span></button>\n      <span class=\"sn-note\">\"刷新\"在 300ms 内完成，所以不出现转圈；另外两个出现转圈后至少留 500ms。</span>\n    </div>"
    }
  ],
